            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "You can disable it based on filetypes. See the [disabling recipes](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/072ef026a538cf4a9dedba56ad8eecffa9e9abb6/doc/mini.txt#L307) in the documentation. I’m on a mobile device or I’d have shown an example as well.",
