        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "As was already said, disabling in buffer [can be done by setting `vim.b.minitrailspace_disable = true`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/072ef026a538cf4a9dedba56ad8eecffa9e9abb6/doc/mini-trailspace.txt#L35-L43). For 'mini.trailspace' in particular this might also require calling [`unhighlight()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/072ef026a538cf4a9dedba56ad8eecffa9e9abb6/doc/mini-trailspace.txt#L78). See also [this recipe for automated disabling in a single buffer](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/072ef026a538cf4a9dedba56ad8eecffa9e9abb6/doc/mini.txt#L339-L341).\r\n\r\nRelated to #535, #423, #167, #85, #52.",
